           bp::args("self", "data", "x", "u"),
           "Compute the actuation signal.\n\n"
           "The thrust forces are read from the state (x[nq+nv:]), while the "
           "control is u = [thrust rates (nf), joint torques (n_joints)]; the "
           "thrust-rate block does not contribute to tau.\n"
           ":param data: floating-base thruster-rates actuation data\n"
           ":param x: state point (dim. state.nx)\n"
